<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - S3 EPS raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - S3 EPS raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said analyst Drew Peck raised the earnings estimate for S3 Inc by $0.01 per share to $0.23 for the third quarter, and by $0.02 to $0.93 for the 1996 year.</p>
<p>-- sees gross margins improving about 100 basis points in each of the next several quarters.</p>
<p>-- kept the stock rated buy.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1-3/8 to 20-1/2.  </p>
<p>-- Peck said his estimates include dilution from an offering last month of $103.5 million of convertible debentures that can convert to common shares.</p>
</text>
